  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개인 API 허브를 구축 이후</span><br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/425\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/425</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/425\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=evuJ&amp;datanum=425\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/425\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/425\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">개인 MCP서버를 구축해보았습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> 기상, 해양 데이터가 많이 들어 있는 개인 API 허브를 확장해서 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MCP서버를 만들었습니다. </span><br>&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e505b2db59588ea613b76ddd357ca80e84b4c3f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e505b2db59588ea613b76ddd357ca80e84b4c3f\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"355\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그리고 안티그래비티IDE에 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개인 MCP서버를 연결해서 성공 하였습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/232b8a6882044baee9d6e5887fa517745ab53b32\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/232b8a6882044baee9d6e5887fa517745ab53b32\" data-origin-width=\"704\" data-origin-height=\"190\"><div class=\"figcaption\">전국 기상, 해양 데이터가 많이 들어 있는 개인 API 허브를 확장해서 MCP서버를 만들었습니다.</div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제 개인 MCP서버 연결된 것을 이용하여,</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이제 앱을 만들어보기 위해<br>안티그래비티 프롬프트 창에 아래와 같이 입력해보았습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c15038c60686a3aa3f2db66d4b9bffd226fd7c01\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c15038c60686a3aa3f2db66d4b9bffd226fd7c01\" data-origin-width=\"377\" data-origin-height=\"126\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">MCP 서버에 들어 있는 데이터는 전국 데이터인데<br>LLM이 데이터를 조회하고, 프롬프트에 맞는</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전라도와 경상도 강수량을 비교해주는 웹앱을 아래와 같이 만들어 줍니다.</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/419287ca6ea57bb49920dfcd67428fed3a168379\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/419287ca6ea57bb49920dfcd67428fed3a168379\" data-origin-width=\"1553\" data-origin-height=\"909\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/353b9ea8ae6441243d534d73c9004747b72ad959\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/353b9ea8ae6441243d534d73c9004747b72ad959\" data-origin-width=\"237\" data-origin-height=\"138\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 로컬로 접속이 가능한 웹앱이 만들어집니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그래서 다시 안티그래비티 프롬프트에 작성합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3840a5d6b5832f9ded3b0114b57159920c4674e8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3840a5d6b5832f9ded3b0114b57159920c4674e8\" data-origin-width=\"435\" data-origin-height=\"123\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그렇더니</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">앱스크립트로 배포까지 해줍니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"로그인 - Google 계정\" data-og-description=\"이메일 또는 휴대전화\" data-og-host=\"accounts.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec&amp;followup=https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec&amp;passive=1209600&amp;flowName=WebLiteSignIn&amp;flowEntry=ServiceLogin&amp;dsh=S2016596117:1789021880019660\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwvV-Hepm4h6efQ772WKX_J416tdUV07z9njkr8awLE-XH90jMJL9SnPt9yQUW8la5L/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">로그인 - Google 계정</p><p class=\"og-desc\">이메일 또는 휴대전화</p><p class=\"og-host\">accounts.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위의 웹앱(전라도와 경상도 강수량을 비교하는 웹앱)을 만든 이유는</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">반도체 클러스터를 전라도에 만들지, 경상도에 만들지에 대한 비교할때</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">뉴스에서 수자원이 중요하다고 이야기를 해서</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위와 같은 빅데이터를 분석하면 실제 데이터로 팩트체크가 가능하죠.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">여튼</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">프롬프트 딱 2번 작성으로 웹앱이 만들어지는 시대입니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(디버깅도 다 해줘서, 정말 프롬프트 딱 2번 작성하고, 각종 승인 여러번 처리만 해주면 만들어지는 시대)</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 링크는 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 내용에서 언급한(=구축한)&#160; &#160;제 개인 API HUB/ MCP 서버 입니다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">키 발급 받아서 설치 활용해보세요(API키 = MCP키 같은)</span><br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwWtj9DT6McqhIr21Ir7KgqRdZAWNusBijrUtX5SMNh27CKS1eSVLqFoxaJBTHHvkPi/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwWtj9DT6McqhIr21Ir7KgqRdZAWNusBijrUtX5SMNh27CKS1eSVLqFoxaJBTHHvkPi/exec</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"승윤과학이 운영하는 개인 API HUB\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwWtj9DT6McqhIr21Ir7KgqRdZAWNusBijrUtX5SMNh27CKS1eSVLqFoxaJBTHHvkPi/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwWtj9DT6McqhIr21Ir7KgqRdZAWNusBijrUtX5SMNh27CKS1eSVLqFoxaJBTHHvkPi/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwWtj9DT6McqhIr21Ir7KgqRdZAWNusBijrUtX5SMNh27CKS1eSVLqFoxaJBTHHvkPi/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwWtj9DT6McqhIr21Ir7KgqRdZAWNusBijrUtX5SMNh27CKS1eSVLqFoxaJBTHHvkPi/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">승윤과학이 운영하는 개인 API HUB</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
